+	 * 100%.
+	 *
+	 * Consider a change from
+	 *     ________
+	 *    /        \______/
+	 *    ^      *        ^
+	 * to
+	 *     ____
+	 *    /    \__________/
+	 *    ^               ^
+	 * At the time marked by *, the new write value will be directly applied
+	 * to SAR even the current period is not over if FIFO is empty.
